      "explanation": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The correct answer is <math alttext=\"35\"><mn>35</mn></math>. The height of each bar in the bar graph shown represents the number of books collected by the group specified at the bottom of the bar. The bar for group <math alttext=\"1\"><mn>1</mn></math> reaches a height of <math alttext=\"35\"><mn>35</mn></math>. Therefore, group <math alttext=\"1\"><mn>1</mn></math> collected <math alttext=\"35\"><mn>35</mn></math> books.</p>",
